---
// Memory.astro — 08 · memory: the first run writes the decision down, the next run
// recalls it and drops to a one-shot.
---

<section id="memory" class="wrap section memory" aria-labelledby="memory-title">
  <div class="memory__copy">
    <span class="eyebrow">08 · MEMORY</span>
    <h2 id="memory-title" class="title">The next run knows what this one decided.</h2>
    <p class="lede">
      Decisions, gotchas and repo facts are written as plain files with where they came from,
      recalled few and ranked when a task needs them, and distilled from each run. Local, plain
      files, yours.
    </p>
  </div>
  <ol class="runs">
    <li class="run">
      <span class="run__key">FIRST RUN</span>
      <span class="run__shape run__shape--three">spec-first</span>
      <span class="run__text">No prior decision: shape it, gate it, write the decision down.</span>
    </li>
    <li class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</li>
    <li class="run">
      <span class="run__key">NEXT RUN</span>
      <span class="run__shape run__shape--one">one-shot</span>
      <span class="run__text">The decision is recalled. Nothing to re-derive.</span>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>

<style>
  .memory {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 48px;
  }

  .memory__copy {
    flex: 1 1 440px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 22px;
  }

  .runs {
    flex: 1 1 520px;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .run {
    flex: 1 1 220px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 22px;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-l);
  }

  .run__key {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }

  .run__shape {
    align-self: flex-start;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-s);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .run__shape--three {
    background: var(--three);
  }

  .run__shape--one {
    background: var(--one);
  }

  .run__text {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }

  .arrow {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .arrow {
      flex-basis: 100%;
      text-align: center;
      transform: rotate(90deg);
      line-height: 1;
    }
  }
</style>
